# Discover Kiribati currently needs no secrets or environment variables —
# it is a fully static site with no server-side API calls, analytics, or
# third-party credentials.
#
# This file exists as a placeholder for the future: if a real form backend,
# analytics tool, or API integration is ever added, its keys should be
# defined here (with placeholder values only — never real credentials) and
# in your deployment platform's environment variable settings, never
# committed as real secrets in this repository.
